    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970411.0072\n\nSYDNEY, April 11 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nAustralian stocks down 0.5 percent\n\n\n\n\nAustralian share prices slipped 0.5 percent Friday in the face of falling base metal prices and lingering concerns over an inflation report due out in the United States, brokers said.\n\nThe Australian Stock Exchange's main indicator, the all ordinaries index, fell 12.4 points to 2,380.5.",
